Still: float the URL and tab islands over a stable page viewport.

Reuse Helium Zen reveal, native omnibox and vertical tabs. Pinned controls remain
floating. Keep content and split-view insets fixed during reveal, retain native
caption and infobar space, and preserve focus/menu access while controls hide.
Changes are confined to browser Views layout and UI preference defaults.

